  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "On the condition, I attached VRC_PickUp and UdonBehaviour to a single GameObject.\nI want to detect a moment when I drop this pickup object using its Udon.\nSo I checked those 2 values in OnDrop(), but:\n- VRC_PickUp.IsHeld always returns false. Even when I just swapped the pickup to another hand.\n- VRCPlayerApi.GetPickupInHand with an argument which the hand I held the pickup returns an instance what I dropped.\nI think it depends on the VRChat specification whether IsHeld returns false even though I have the pickup, or whether the instance is returned even though I don't have the pickup, which is the correct interpretation, but in any case I feel there is a inconsistency here.\nWhat is the correct interpretation of OnDrop? And I would like these 2 values to be consistent.",
